WEBVTT

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:41.990
Tazuna, look.

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:54.590
It's not your Ziggurat...

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:58.590
This is his Nimrod.

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:00.840
Gold Cocoon

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:03.100
and Silver Cocoon.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:13.110
Let's begin.

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:16.610
You who would meet and challenge God...

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:19.270
You, the Hand Shakers...

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:29.880
Let's fall back.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:40.900
Can we beat them with speed?

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:45.470
No.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:53.730
Not good!

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:01.740
Are you okay with this, Koyori?

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.490
Fighting your big sister?

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:07.750
I used to be connected to her.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.750
Now I'm connected to you.

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:14.250
I fought a lot of people and 
am connected to them now.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.420
It'll be the same this time.

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:19.640
If I fight her, I should be able 
to connect with her somehow.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:36.570
What?

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:43.200
I think she's just like the 
old me, and has no feelings.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:46.010
So she's just attacking everything.

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:51.710
That was close.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.100
They got ahead of us?

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:15.350
I understand how you will move.

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.220
I'll protect you.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.090
Thank you.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.510
Because we're together.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:16.540
They're strong.

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:20.810
Our shield, which was stopping 
Kodama-san's attack, has been destroyed.

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.720
Our Nimrod itself is being taken over.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:25.370
And...

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:27.480
My sword can't beat him.

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:35.550
I know.

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:37.130
I'm not alone.

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:41.320
You're...

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:43.640
You don't need sympathy.

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:49.070
Fight, Mayumi.

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.330
Don't rest.

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:03.520
Sis...

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:04.460
I see.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:09.100
The way she fights, it's like 
destroying her Nimrod over and over.

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:12.470
If she keeps creating so many 
each time she does that...

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.720
Are you okay with your partner disappearing?

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:18.730
She's together with Koyori, right?

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.280
It's the best move.

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:23.400
You will fall before Mayumi disappears.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.320
Damn it!

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.740
You used drugs, hurt her...

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:32.150
We'll win. Together!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.990
Make it mesh, Koyori!

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:37.500
Right, Tazuna!

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:46.950
I see.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:50.640
You thought that if you lured me here,

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:53.280
I couldn't use my explosions.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:54.780
A bad move.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:58.040
This is the end.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:07.920
That's crazy.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.460
Unleash.

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:56.890
Let's go.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:57.970
Yeah.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:32.130
Not yet!

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:19.940
We win.

00:10:20.690 --> 00:10:22.180
The fight is...

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:23.890
It's not over!

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.290
I won't let it be over!

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:33.240
Mayumi...

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:37.520
Stop it.

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:38.950
Mayumi, you're at your limit!

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.950
I will protect you.

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:43.540
She spoke?

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.850
Stop it. You can't fight anymore!

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:12.850
You're going to disappear!

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.960
Stop it, please!

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:28.620
We'll make it mesh!

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.630
They took the hand of their enemy?

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:42.900
We can do it.

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:45.640
It meshes.

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.140
It stopped?

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:53.650
I was charged?

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:57.960
We should be enemies, but my strength...

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:02.330
It's because I used to be 
partners with my sister.

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.430
Why?

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:07.080
Koyori wanted to save you.

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:09.300
So did I.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:14.840
You had no guarantee it would work!

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:38.380
So I've lost my will to fight, huh?

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:44.450
I guess I'm weak.

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:57.240
Nagaoka-san, why did you do this?

00:12:57.240 --> 00:13:02.460
You could've just kept doing 
research with Makihara-sensei.

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:07.000
There was no need to make 
Koyori fight her sister.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.470
Why did you do this?

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:12.470
Because he's kind.

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:14.730
Mayumi, your emotions...

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:19.980
Mayumi-kun.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.030
I know everything.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:24.990
I can feel a heart that's too strong.

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:28.410
Warm hands.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.930
Gentle feelings.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:33.500
He's really sick, you see.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.750
For three years now, 
he's been saying the end is near.

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:43.210
I knew that on that day.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:47.400
That's why he gave up doing research.

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:52.580
He only fought battles 
where he sacrificed himself.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:56.270
You knew from the start?

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:01.760
My heart was lost once.

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:04.280
My feelings and bond with you...

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:07.410
It's true that they started 
with lies and suggestions.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:08.280
But...

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:13.130
But I could feel your heart.

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:14.290
That's why I'm

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:16.290
the same as you.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.290
Yeah.

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:20.380
Why didn't you tell me?

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:22.380
We were partners, right?

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.800
There must have been 
something I could've done.

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.550
It was because we were partners.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.800
You wouldn't agree.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:32.100
I know you better than anyone.

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:45.570
I'm sorry, I guess.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.850
Don't guess!

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:51.570
You need to learn how to 
say what you're thinking.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:55.800
I'm supposed to believe that humans 
are fundamentally good, but...

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:57.580
Takatsuki Tazuna.

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:00.170
That was amazing.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:01.720
Let us meet again,

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.590
before I meet my end.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:16.170
You really are positively

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:20.600
terrible at saying what you think, 
and you always do things in the worst way...

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:23.180
And you're a kind man.

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:46.920
See ya.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:54.220
<b>Makihara Labs</b>

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:54.220
<b>It says Makihara!</b>

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:56.980
You're as healthy as a horse.

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:01.230
You barely need these exams anymore.

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:02.750
I'm glad.

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:06.980
But her nature still hasn't changed.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:08.170
That's okay.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:09.990
We're together.

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:12.200
I guess I didn't need to say it, huh?

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:14.010
It's been a month since then.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:16.250
I'm glad your wounds have totally healed.

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.120
Um...

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:21.500
What happened to that guy... Nagaoka-sensei?

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:23.440
Right now, he's...

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:26.250
Actually, I haven't looked.

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:31.630
But now that he's shown up, 
I can find him if I search.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:35.950
I was with him for a long time.

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:39.140
You both used everything 
you had in that fight.

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:41.660
You don't have to worry about it.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:46.480
He's really terrible at talking, as you saw.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.810
Someday I'll find him and bring him to you.

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:50.990
Positivity is my motto,

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:53.150
and I believe that humans 
are fundamentally good.

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:58.160
So would you let me take care of your sister?

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:02.640
I'll take care of things, like an adult.

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:04.910
Thanks, Makihara-sensei.

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:08.720
No, that's mostly my line.

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:11.160
Oh, want some shumai?

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:11.920
No thanks.

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:14.730
You're leaving, right?

00:17:14.730 --> 00:17:16.180
I'm sorry.

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:18.620
Oh, what happened with your job?

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:19.930
You're doing it together?

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:21.750
It starts next week.

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:25.070
I have to call Chizuru-san.

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:27.080
Okay, we'll be going.

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:27.940
Sure.

00:17:36.470 --> 00:17:40.240
You who will overcome many 
battles and trials...

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:42.140
You who received the Revelation.

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:44.950
You who would challenge me.

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:47.860
Yes, you, the Hand Shaker, huh?

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:51.210
What was this God guy thinking?

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:54.670
Was he looking for someone with 
the power to challenge Him?

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.470
Or did he just want to see people fight?

00:17:58.840 --> 00:17:59.970
Or perhaps...

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.970
When I look at those two,

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:05.940
I think it might be something else.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.650
Because I'm thinking positively.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:13.920
They say they'll work here.

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:15.450
That's a big help!

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:16.670
I can't wait.

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:19.720
Can you get them to respect you?

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:21.680
I'm sorry I'm not worthy of respect.

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:22.990
Don't give up.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.080
The Sun.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.460
Success. A promised future.

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:29.800
Masaru, what do we do?

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:32.040
It says a promised future!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.820
We're going shopping for our trip, right?

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:35.000
We're busy.

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:38.010
<i>My song's on sale now!</i>

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:41.420
Amazing! You're so pretty, Kodama-chan.

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:44.010
No, I'm just about to start carving.

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:50.070
What is it?

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.020
Nothing...

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:56.050
Hey, Sensei.

00:18:56.050 --> 00:18:59.030
I want to eat a parfait with you.

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:01.030
You've gotten honest.

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:05.750
I always was.

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:09.270
That's why I didn't talk.

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:13.040
Sensei?

00:19:13.780 --> 00:19:14.920
I know.

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:18.300
A place where we can get a parfait.

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.050
What?

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:27.400
Hey, Sensei.

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:31.770
When I meet God there's 
something I want to ask Him.

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:33.380
Yeah.

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:36.310
To save you and Koyori.

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:40.330
I'll make it happen before I meet my end.

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:48.920
My wish is something else.

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:01.770
Rei-kun, you're taking up an instrument?

00:20:01.770 --> 00:20:05.410
No, I'll be supporting the people 
who play the instruments.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:06.460
I'll be in the background.

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:09.310
You're nice, so that's 
the perfect job for you.

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:10.340
Yeah?

00:20:12.150 --> 00:20:13.100
That's...

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.880
Those two...

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:19.070
Beat that God guy, okay?

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:23.380
What is it?

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:54.360
Tazuna, I want to try riding a bike.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.740
We'll learn to ride one.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:01.150
So we can be like this more.

00:21:01.880 --> 00:21:03.720
Even when that happens, we'll be together.

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:06.010
Yeah.

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:10.910
Then we're together, no matter what happens.

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:16.860
Let's go.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.470
Together!

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:25.260
You who received the Revelation of Babel.

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:29.850
You who will overcome many 
battles and trials...

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.430
You who received the Revelation.

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:35.270
You who would challenge me.

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:38.640
Yes, you, the Hand Shaker...

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:39.940
Just kidding.
